### Models with the Fax Function Only

To reduce the risk of fire, electrical shock, and injury to people;

- Use only a No. 26 AWG or larger telecommunication line cord.

### Models with the Fax Function Only

To reduce the risk of fire, electrical shock, and injury to people;

- Use only a No. 26 AWG or larger telecommunication line cord.

2. Connect each end of the line cord to:

- the telephone socket at the bottom of the base station;
- the telephone socket on the wall.
